{"id":"ad4722aacf87aee1","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-consistency-hilbert-interface.md","title":"一致性与 Hilbert 目标的编码接口","display":"df-consistency-hilbert-interface — 一致性与 Hilbert 目标的编码接口","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-consistency-hilbert-interface","aliases":["18-df-consistency-hilbert-interface","18-df-001"],"display":"df-consistency-hilbert-interface — 一致性与 Hilbert 目标的编码接口","depends_on":["[[18-df-provable]]","[[18-df-sentence]]","[[18-df-satisfaction]]"],"source_title":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity","source_edition":"Springer, 2009; ISBN 978-3-540-69318-5","source_section":"1 Historical Background","source_printed_pages":"2–3","source_pdf_pages":"13–14","source_correspondence":"historical-goal-interface","source_statement_status":"checked-2026-10-13"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-consistency-hilbert-interface"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-consistency-hilbert-interface</span><span>18-df-001</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-consistency-hilbert-interface — 一致性与 Hilbert 目标的编码接口"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9cea4880793901f3\" href=\"?note=9cea4880793901f3\" title=\"18-df-provable\">18-df-provable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"20cb1a93869734ac\" href=\"?note=20cb1a93869734ac\" title=\"18-df-sentence\">18-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"23419e8036fb68bd\" href=\"?note=23419e8036fb68bd\" title=\"18-df-satisfaction\">18-df-satisfaction</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_title","html":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Springer, 2009; ISBN 978-3-540-69318-5"},{"key":"source_section","html":"1 Historical Background"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"2–3"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"13–14"},{"key":"source_correspondence","html":"historical-goal-interface"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-2026-10-13"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P\">\\(\\mathcal P\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}\">\\(\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9cea4880793901f3\" href=\"?note=9cea4880793901f3\" title=\"18-df-provable\">18-df-provable</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(\\bot\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span> 是固定矛盾句，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span> 是理论参数；句子见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"20cb1a93869734ac\" href=\"?note=20cb1a93869734ac\" title=\"18-df-sentence\">18-df-sentence</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\subseteq\\operatorname{Pow}(\\mathrm{Fml}_S)\">\\(D\\subseteq\\operatorname{Pow}(\\mathrm{Fml}_S)\\)</span> 是给定理论集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa:D\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(\\kappa:D\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span> 是给定的对象句编码接口，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak N\">\\(\\mathfrak N\\)</span> 是具有签名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 的给定算术结构，满足关系见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"23419e8036fb68bd\" href=\"?note=23419e8036fb68bd\" title=\"18-df-satisfaction\">18-df-satisfaction</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RepCon}_{\\mathcal P}(\\kappa,\\mathfrak N)\">\\(\\mathrm{RepCon}_{\\mathcal P}(\\kappa,\\mathfrak N)\\)</span> 检查该接口的语义正确性；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HilbertProgram}_{\\mathcal P,\\kappa}\">\\(\\mathrm{HilbertProgram}_{\\mathcal P,\\kappa}\\)</span> 仅记录形式一致性证明目标，不把“有穷主义”化约为可证性。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathcal P}(T)\\longleftrightarrow\n\\neg(T\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}\\bot).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathcal P}(T)\\longleftrightarrow\n\\neg(T\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}\\bot).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RepCon}_{\\mathcal P}(\\kappa,\\mathfrak N)\\longleftrightarrow\n\\forall T\\in D\\;(\\mathfrak N\\models\\kappa(T)\\longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathcal P}(T)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{RepCon}_{\\mathcal P}(\\kappa,\\mathfrak N)\\longleftrightarrow\n\\forall T\\in D\\;(\\mathfrak N\\models\\kappa(T)\\longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathcal P}(T)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HilbertProgram}_{\\mathcal P,\\kappa}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle T,F\\rangle\\in D\\times D:\n\\mathrm{RepCon}_{\\mathcal P}(\\kappa,\\mathfrak N)\n\\land F\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}\\kappa(T)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{HilbertProgram}_{\\mathcal P,\\kappa}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle T,F\\rangle\\in D\\times D:\n\\mathrm{RepCon}_{\\mathcal P}(\\kappa,\\mathfrak N)\n\\land F\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}\\kappa(T)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>§1 印刷p2–3阐述 Hilbert 的历史计划。本节点是对其形式一致性证明目标的辅助编码接口，不是书中 Definition 1。原稿直接将元语言 Con(T) 放在 ⊢ 右侧，现用对象句 κ(T) 区分；没有断言任意理论都有这种可有效构造的编码，也没有把F的有穷主义资格当成已经解决。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id