\mathfrak N","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RepCon}_{\\mathcal P}(\\kappa,\\mathfrak N)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HilbertProgram}_{\\mathcal P,\\kappa}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathcal P}(T)\\longleftrightarrow\n\\neg(T\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}\\bot).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RepCon}_{\\mathcal P}(\\kappa,\\mathfrak N)\\longleftrightarrow\n\\forall T\\in D\\;(\\mathfrak N\\models\\kappa(T)\\longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathcal P}(T)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HilbertProgram}_{\\mathcal P,\\kappa}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle T,F\\rangle\\in D\\times D:\n\\mathrm{RepCon}_{\\mathcal P}(\\kappa,\\mathfrak N)\n\\land F\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}\\kappa(T)\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":2246,"backlinks":[{"id":"98c11a88e50650e8","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathfrak N$ 是具有同一签名 $S$ 的给定算术结构；假定 $\\mathfrak N\\models C_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathcal P}(A_{\\mathrm{PA}})$，其中一致性及满足接口见 [[18-df-consistency-hilbert-interface]]。"},{"id":"b90047664466f5b8","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Incomplete}_{\\mathcal P}$、$\\mathrm{Incompleteness}_{1,\\mathcal P}$ 为下式引入的谓词；$\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathcal P}(T)$ 见 [[18-df-consistency-hilbert-interface]]；本节点定义结论模式，不将其作为对任意T成立的不完备性定理。"},{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-29","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-df-consistency-hilbert-interface]]"},{"id":"100d7af02276fe1b","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-consistency-hilbert-interface]]"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-25","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-consistency-hilbert-interface]]"},{"id":"bf01645e59119446","anchor":"ref-22","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-consistency-hilbert-interface|18-df-consistency-hilbert-interface]]"},{"id":"09f8f6fb03023072","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[.